  "Seed_Compilation_Status": "Successful",
  "Trigger_Explanation": "The bug is triggered when the 'getStudentGrade' method is called with'student2' as an argument. Even though'student1' and'student2' have the same 'name' and 'id', they are not considered equal in the Hashtable because the 'Student' class does not override the 'hashCode()' method.",
